{"id":26331,"date":"2021-09-20T08:47:15","date_gmt":"2021-09-20T07:47:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/?p=26331"},"modified":"2023-05-17T10:55:09","modified_gmt":"2023-05-17T09:55:09","slug":"learning-to-use-excel","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/learning-to-use-excel\/","title":{"rendered":"7 Benefits Of Learning To Use Excel"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Learning to use Excel can have many benefits both in your personal and professional life. Not only is Excel a great tool for organisation and databases, but it can also be used to automate tasks, link systems and create dashboards.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/microsoft-excel-training-courses\/\">Excel training courses<\/a> are the first place to turn in if you&#8217;re looking to build Excel skills because you get hands-on experience of using Excel in a business capacity.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Why Is Excel Important?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Microsoft Excel is an essential tool for many businesses which makes Excel skills in huge demand.&nbsp;It has risen to become one of the most popular data entry and analysis tools on the market.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today, Excel is part of Microsoft\u2019s Office 365 suite of programs and is used by <a href=\"https:\/\/www.statista.com\/statistics\/983321\/worldwide-office-365-user-numbers-by-country\/\">millions of companies<\/a> and individuals around the world. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-microsoft-office-skills-cv\/\">Listing Excel skills on your CV<\/a> can really make you stand out!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As such, you should consider learning to use Excel to its fullest if you want to make the most of the program and customise your workbooks to the needs of your company and specific projects.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here are some of the benefits of learning to use Microsoft Excel and how to make the most of this innovative tool.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"668\" src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Benefits-Of-Learning-To-Use-Excel-1024x668.jpg\" alt=\"Benefits Of Learning To Use Excel\" class=\"wp-image-30651\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Benefits-Of-Learning-To-Use-Excel-1024x668.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Benefits-Of-Learning-To-Use-Excel-300x196.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Benefits-Of-Learning-To-Use-Excel-768x501.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Benefits-Of-Learning-To-Use-Excel.jpg 1290w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Excel Is A Popular And Accessible Program<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Businesses throughout the world and across the corporate landscape use Excel for their data analysis and reporting.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It\u2019s easy to access Excel: Microsoft Office 365 is usually downloaded on new computers, and all you need to do is sign-up for a plan or sign in to your account.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So, whatever business you\u2019re in and whatever role you have, you can access Excel and make use of it. The tool can be used for everything from sending automatic emails to updating invoice records, thanks to its formulas and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-macro-enabled-workbook\/\">macros<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\" style=\"grid-template-columns:22% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><a href=\"https:\/\/amzn.to\/3JJc9a1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"206\" height=\"264\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/The-Excel-2023-Book.png\" alt=\"The Excel 2023 Book\" class=\"wp-image-33052 size-full lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 206px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 206\/264;\" \/><\/a><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Discover how to use Microsoft Excel with the latest edition from Leonard J Ledger.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-black-color has-luminous-vivid-amber-background-color has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/amzn.to\/3JJc9a1\" style=\"border-radius:7px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Buy Now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">By Learning To Use Excel To The Fullest, You Can Make The Most Of It<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As mentioned above, there are many uses for Excel, but if you don\u2019t understand how to make the most of them, you won\u2019t be able to use Excel to its full potential.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It\u2019s possible to use <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/bespoke-tools\/\">bespoke Excel tools<\/a> to make the most of the program and all of the ways that it can be personalised.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you don\u2019t fully understand <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-spreadsheet-help\/\">Excel <\/a><\/strong>and know how it can be used, you won\u2019t be able to make the most of it. Also, you might waste money and time on additional software products that you wouldn\u2019t need if you used Excel properly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"668\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-How-To-Use-Excel-1024x668.jpg\" alt=\"Learning How To Use Excel\" class=\"wp-image-30652 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-How-To-Use-Excel-1024x668.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-How-To-Use-Excel-300x196.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-How-To-Use-Excel-768x501.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-How-To-Use-Excel.jpg 1290w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/668;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Your Business Can Improve Its Data Management<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every business uses data, including information about its payroll, invoices, finances, sale targets and more. As well as <a href=\"https:\/\/www.voxco.com\/blog\/numerical-data-types-and-characteristics\/#:~:text=Numerical%20data%20refers%20to%20the,be%20statistically%20and%20arithmetically%20calculated.\">numerical data<\/a>, you might also have long lists of contact details and personal data on your customers or staff.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All of this data is just numbers and letters unless you use it correctly. If you present your data neatly and use formulas to develop averages and percentages, then you can use your <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/what-is-excel-data-analysis\/\">data<\/a> to inform your business practices and improve your strategies.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Excel offers users the chance to make the most of<a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/guide-microsoft-excel-formulas\/\"> formulas<\/a>, graphs and other tools to lay out their data and understand how it could be interpreted to suit their needs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-cyan-bluish-gray-background-color has-background is-style-wide\"\/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><p><a href=\"https:\/\/click.linksynergy.com\/link?id=EJwqZBxBmNA&amp;offerid=1060092.1105404&amp;type=2&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.udemy.com%2Fcourse%2Fexcel-crash-course-full-tutorial%2F\"><img decoding=\"async\" border=\"0\" data-src=\"https:\/\/img-c.udemycdn.com\/course\/480x270\/1105404_aca0_22.jpg\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\"><\/a><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" border=\"0\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"https:\/\/ad.linksynergy.com\/fs-bin\/show?id=EJwqZBxBmNA&amp;bids=1060092.1105404&amp;type=2&amp;subid=0\"><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Microsoft Excel Udemy Course &#8211; Excel from Beginner to Advanced 2023<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-green-cyan-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/click.linksynergy.com\/link?id=EJwqZBxBmNA&amp;offerid=1060092.1105404&amp;type=2&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.udemy.com%2Fcourse%2Fexcel-crash-course-full-tutorial%2F\" style=\"border-radius:7px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Enrol Now!<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-cyan-bluish-gray-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-cyan-bluish-gray-background-color has-background is-style-wide\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">You Can Create Custom Workbooks That Meet Your Precise Needs<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Excel can be used in many ways, and you don\u2019t have to use the workbooks as they come. You can get <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/custom-excel-spreadsheets\/\">custom workbooks<\/a> made by companies such as The Excel Experts, which can allow you to automate basic tasks or portray your data in the best possible way.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our unique workbooks can be custom-made to suit your purposes. Before you commission us to make you a custom Excel workbook, you must <a href=\"https:\/\/amzn.to\/3JJc9a1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">understand how Excel works<\/a> and what we can do for you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you don\u2019t understand how Excel works, then you won\u2019t be able to work out how it can benefit you, and you might struggle to make the most of your custom workbook, even with the help of a team of experts such as ours.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So, you need to make sure that you <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/microsoft-excel-tuition\/\">learn to use Excel<\/a> and work out how you can use it. You don\u2019t need to become an Excel Wizard- we\u2019ve got you covered there!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">But, with a rudimentary knowledge of the program, you can make the most of it as your business grows and prospers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"668\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-Excel-1024x668.jpg\" alt=\"Learning Excel\" class=\"wp-image-30653 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-Excel-1024x668.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-Excel-300x196.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-Excel-768x501.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-Excel.jpg 1290w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/668;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">It\u2019s Possible To Automate Basic Tasks If You Know How<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Modern business leaders are always short on time and long on tasks to complete. That\u2019s why Microsoft has worked hard to offer automation options <a href=\"https:\/\/amzn.to\/3JJc9a1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">within Excel.<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/enabling-macros-excel\/\">Using Macros<\/a>, which are instructions built into a workbook using VBA code, Excel\u2019s programming language, you can connect Excel to other programs such as Outlook, Word and more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You can then get your workbook to automatically send emails, fill in data points and more. These tasks might seem small, but as your business expands and you have more data to handle, you could find that Macros in Excel save you many man-hours.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Don\u2019t worry- you don\u2019t need to learn VBA code to make the most of macros! The team here at The Excel Experts can help you to create <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/automation\/\">Excel automation<\/a> tools and show you and your staff how to use them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While we can create your macros for you, you\u2019ll need to understand the tools and the basics of how VBA works to make the most of them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That means learning to use Excel and gaining an understanding of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-vba-for-mac\/\">VBA code<\/a>. With this knowledge, you can understand the applications of Excel automation and how you can use it to help your growing business to improve efficiency and be more effective.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understanding Excel Will Reduce Accidents And Improve Company Efficiency<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When you\u2019re storing large volumes of business-critical data on a program, it\u2019s crucial that everyone with access to it knows how to use it correctly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you make even a minor mistake, you could undo all your hard work and potentially erase valuable information.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As such, you need to learn <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-services\">how to use Excel<\/a> to reduce the number of mistakes you make. With an understanding of the program, you can also undo or rectify any minor errors that you do make before they cause significant damage to your workbook.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"668\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Learning-To-Use-Excel-Spreadsheets-1024x668.jpg\" alt=\"Learning To Use Excel